fin-market-rules:RuleClauseShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Rule Clause, is the abstract ordered executable clause superclass belonging to one exact market-rule version, used for carrying the concrete executable semantics of a rule. Concrete clause families specialize this class: range clauses carry an input interval with explicit boundaries and endpoint inclusivity and check ordering completeness against the rule's gap policy; trigger, date, and entitlement clauses carry their own typed semantics without requiring an input range. The bound and inclusivity attributes are optional here and apply only to range-bearing clauses.";
    sh:name "Rule Clause";
    sh:property <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/attribute/54c04462ac487f33b45c4ef7>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/attribute/65e49bd83396d3ace902e361>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/attribute/69a57780cdcd458ca32ef78e>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/attribute/b4dce6bbd069e52702d6ecdd>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/attribute/cda71a54c89f22c7b406fc2c>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/attribute/fc87746633d8c6532d452acb>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/immutable-version/1546f4be8593f8b2da423607>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/immutable-version/af9bccfcc999a1901c9cfbc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/provenance/910a4941731155c4c7cafbfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/provenance/f31743343a8f991854642cfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/temporal/03727e96cec2b79c1d8f9f29>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/temporal/af6029d9b458f2ce4f75cff7>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/temporal/f05c2d086ac5a605305520ea>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleClause/shape/temporal/f0f2f601393d100a35dc2429>;
