fin-market-rules:RuleConflictShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Rule Conflict, is a no-winner association fact emitted when at least two surviving applicability versions produce incompatible typed results for one exact evaluation request, used for recording rule conflicts that cannot be silently resolved along with the candidate-set fingerprint. It is the association-typed counterpart of the conflict branch of the RuleSelectionOutcome hierarchy: it carries a selectionOutcomeKind of conflict and is bound to its evaluation request by outcomeForRequest, so the conflict path is one branch of the outcome model rather than the only modeled result. The M3 association-type profile does not allow an association to subtype an object type, so RuleConflict aligns with the outcome hierarchy by value rather than by inheritance.";
    sh:name "Rule Conflict";
    sh:property <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/attribute/19e4926c4614a7b0502a19f3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/attribute/525d107a430c0f43b3909568>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/attribute/add485b2a6e84776ea9e4917>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/immutable-version/1546f4be8593f8b2da423607>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/immutable-version/af9bccfcc999a1901c9cfbc3>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/imported-attribute/9b634b38293544ecdb3cffe9>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/participant-role-candidateApplicabilityVersion/f226a8e86b9df1d3f72cba12>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/participant-role-evaluationRequestVersion/6b6ae8f83df8117b1e802f30>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/provenance/910a4941731155c4c7cafbfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/provenance/f31743343a8f991854642cfe>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/temporal/03727e96cec2b79c1d8f9f29>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/temporal/af6029d9b458f2ce4f75cff7>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/temporal/f05c2d086ac5a605305520ea>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/RuleConflict/shape/temporal/f0f2f601393d100a35dc2429>;
